                    "copy": "© 2011-2023 Private Division LLC. Developed by Squad. Private Division and Kerbal Space Program and their respective logos are trademarks of Private Division LLC. All other marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
